#   how to structure a treasury) are general educational guidance, not tailored legal/financial
#   advice to a named organization or individual — flagged high_risk + public-use-boundary
#   below per the ingest skill's "funding/governance recs" trigger, out of caution, rather than
#   treated as a clear-cut case either way.
# - Did not create a separate resource card for DAOhaus — mentioned once as a lighter-weight
#   alternative to Safe+Snapshot, not developed further in the article.
